{
  "message": "Starting the Parcelly ↔ Spokes integration. I've drafted schemas, operations, webhooks, secrets, and provider scenarios based on Parcelly's API. Several mismatches with the consumer's expectations need business decisions: (1) Parcelly sends 'shipment.status_changed' webhooks, but Spokes expects payment confirmations at '/orders/{id}/pay' — we need to decide on a mapping or adapter. (2) Spokes needs to know the exact order ID format for webhook construction. (3) Spokes asks about signature/auth headers and refund/cancellation notifications. I've captured these as decisions with owner=provider and added provider-side scenarios for core flows. Please answer the questions below so we can finalize the contract.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/secrets/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "partner_api_key",
        "description": "Bearer token used by the consumer (Spokes) to authenticate with Parcelly API"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/secrets/-",
      "value": {
        "name": "webhook_secret",
        "description": "HMAC-SHA256 secret used by Parcelly to sign webhook payloads sent to Spokes"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/shipment",
      "value": "A parcel or pallet shipment created by a partner, tracked through statuses CREATED → COLLECTED → IN_TRANSIT → DELIVERED (or RETURNED)"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/partner",
      "value": "The consumer (Spokes) as a registered partner in Parcelly, identified by partnerId and authenticated via partner_api_key"
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/idempotency_key",
      "value": "Partner-provided key (header Idempotency-Key) scoped to the partner; blank or missing key is treated as no key. Duplicate key with same partner returns the original shipment (idempotent replay). Keys >255 chars are rejected."
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/size_weight_map",
      "value": "Parcel size (A/B/C) derived from weight_g: A ≤5000g, B ≤15000g, C ≤25000g. Size must match weight-derived size or SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH error."
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/glossary/postcode_city_validation",
      "value": "Polish postcode prefix (first two digits) must map to the receiver's city (case-insensitive, NFC normalization, Polish chars matter). Mismatch → POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH."
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/CreateParcelShipmentRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "reference",
          "receiver",
          "parcel"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "reference": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "receiver": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "phone",
              "address"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^\\+48\\d{9}$"
              },
              "address": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "street",
                  "building",
                  "postcode",
                  "city",
                  "country"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "street": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "building": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "postcode": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^\\d{2}-\\d{3}$"
                  },
                  "city": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "country": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "PL"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "parcel": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "size"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "maximum": 25000
              },
              "size": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "A",
                  "B",
                  "C"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/CreatePalletShipmentRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "reference",
          "receiver",
          "pallet"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "reference": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "receiver": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "phone",
              "address"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^\\+48\\d{9}$"
              },
              "address": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "street",
                  "building",
                  "postcode",
                  "city",
                  "country"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "street": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "building": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "postcode": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^\\d{2}-\\d{3}$"
                  },
                  "city": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  },
                  "country": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "PL"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "pallet": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "pallet_type"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 25001,
                "maximum": 1000000
              },
              "pallet_type": {
                "type": "string",
                "const": "EUR"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/ShipmentResponse",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "service",
          "partnerId",
          "reference",
          "status",
          "trackingNumber",
          "priceGr",
          "receiver",
          "createdAt",
          "updatedAt"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^shp_\\d+$"
          },
          "service": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "parcel",
              "pallet"
            ]
          },
          "partnerId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "reference": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "CREATED",
              "COLLECTED",
              "IN_TRANSIT",
              "DELIVERED",
              "RETURNED"
            ]
          },
          "trackingNumber": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "priceGr": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "receiver": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "name",
              "phone",
              "address"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "address": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "street",
                  "building",
                  "postcode",
                  "city",
                  "country"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "street": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "building": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "postcode": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "city": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "country": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "parcel": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "size"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "size": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "nullable": true
          },
          "pallet": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "weight_g",
              "pallet_type"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "weight_g": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "pallet_type": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "nullable": true
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/ShipmentListResponse",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "shipment"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "shipment": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/ErrorResponse",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "INVALID_JSON",
              "INVALID_REQUEST",
              "INVALID_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY",
              "UNAUTHORIZED",
              "INVALID_PHONE",
              "INVALID_POSTCODE",
              "WEIGHT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED",
              "SIZE_WEIGHT_MISMATCH",
              "POSTCODE_CITY_MISMATCH",
              "PALLET_WEIGHT_OUT_OF_RANGE",
              "REFERENCE_REQUIRED",
              "SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND"
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/WebhookRegistrationRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "secret"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "secret": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/WebhookRegistrationResponse",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "url",
          "secret"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "url": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "secret": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/schemas/ShipmentStatusChangedEvent",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "event",
          "shipment_id",
          "reference",
          "status",
          "occurred_at"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "event": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "shipment.status_changed"
          },
          "shipment_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "reference": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "CREATED",
              "COLLECTED",
              "IN_TRANSIT",
              "DELIVERED",
              "RETURNED"
            ]
          },
          "occurred_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/create_parcel_shipment",
      "value": {
        "description": "Create a new parcel shipment (weight ≤ 25000g). Idempotency-Key header prevents duplicate charges.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/shipments",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            },
            "Idempotency-Key": {
              "required": false,
              "pattern": "^.{1,255}$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/CreateParcelShipmentRequest"
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentResponse"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 201,
          "body": {
            "id": "shp_{{seq}}",
            "service": "parcel",
            "partnerId": "prt_1",
            "reference": "{{request.body.reference}}",
            "status": "CREATED",
            "trackingNumber": "PCL{{seq}}PL",
            "priceGr": 1299,
            "receiver": "{{request.body.receiver}}",
            "parcel": "{{request.body.parcel}}",
            "pallet": null,
            "createdAt": "{{now}}",
            "updatedAt": "{{now}}"
          },
          "idempotent_on_header": "Idempotency-Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/create_pallet_shipment",
      "value": {
        "description": "Create a new pallet shipment (weight 25001–1000000g).",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/pallets",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            },
            "Idempotency-Key": {
              "required": false,
              "pattern": "^.{1,255}$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/CreatePalletShipmentRequest"
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentResponse"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 201,
          "body": {
            "id": "shp_{{seq}}",
            "service": "pallet",
            "partnerId": "prt_1",
            "reference": "{{request.body.reference}}",
            "status": "CREATED",
            "trackingNumber": "PAL{{seq}}PL",
            "priceGr": 50000,
            "receiver": "{{request.body.receiver}}",
            "parcel": null,
            "pallet": "{{request.body.pallet}}",
            "createdAt": "{{now}}",
            "updatedAt": "{{now}}"
          },
          "idempotent_on_header": "Idempotency-Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/get_shipment_by_reference",
      "value": {
        "description": "Retrieve the most recent shipment for a given partner reference.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/shipments",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          },
          "query": {
            "reference": {
              "type": "string",
              "required": true
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentListResponse"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "shipment": {
              "id": "shp_1",
              "service": "parcel",
              "partnerId": "prt_1",
              "reference": "{{request.query.reference}}",
              "status": "CREATED",
              "trackingNumber": "PCL1PL",
              "priceGr": 1299,
              "receiver": {
                "name": "Jan Kowalski",
                "phone": "+48600100200",
                "address": {
                  "street": "Długa",
                  "building": "5",
                  "postcode": "00-001",
                  "city": "Warszawa",
                  "country": "PL"
                }
              },
              "parcel": {
                "weight_g": 1200,
                "size": "A"
              },
              "pallet": null,
              "createdAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z",
              "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/get_shipment_by_id",
      "value": {
        "description": "Retrieve a specific shipment by its ID, scoped to the authenticated partner.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/shipments/{id}",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentResponse"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "id": "{{request.path.id}}",
            "service": "parcel",
            "partnerId": "prt_1",
            "reference": "ORD-1001",
            "status": "CREATED",
            "trackingNumber": "PCL1PL",
            "priceGr": 1299,
            "receiver": {
              "name": "Jan Kowalski",
              "phone": "+48600100200",
              "address": {
                "street": "Długa",
                "building": "5",
                "postcode": "00-001",
                "city": "Warszawa",
                "country": "PL"
              }
            },
            "parcel": {
              "weight_g": 1200,
              "size": "A"
            },
            "pallet": null,
            "createdAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z",
            "updatedAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00.000Z"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/register_webhook",
      "value": {
        "description": "Register or replace the webhook endpoint and secret for the authenticated partner.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/v1/webhooks",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookRegistrationRequest"
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookRegistrationResponse"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "url": "{{request.body.url}}",
            "secret": "{{request.body.secret}}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/operations/get_webhook",
      "value": {
        "description": "Retrieve the currently registered webhook configuration for the authenticated partner.",
        "direction": "consumer_to_provider",
        "request": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/v1/webhooks",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^Bearer .+$"
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/WebhookRegistrationResponse"
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "body": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "stub": {
          "default_status": 200,
          "body": {
            "url": "https://shop.example.com/parcelly/webhook",
            "secret": "whsec_test_secret"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/webhooks/shipment_status_changed",
      "value": {
        "description": "Parcelly posts this event when a shipment's status changes. Signed with HMAC-SHA256 over raw body.",
        "direction": "provider_to_consumer",
        "request": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "${CONSUMER_WEBHOOK_URL}",
          "headers": {
            "X-Signature": {
              "required": true,
              "pattern": "^sha256=[0-9a-f]{64}$"
            }
          },
          "body": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/ShipmentStatusChangedEvent"
          }
        },
        "signature": {
          "algorithm": "hmac-sha256",
          "header": "X-Signature",
          "format": "sha256={hex}",
          "over": "raw_body",
          "secret": "webhook_secret"
        },
        "consumer_responses": {
          "valid_signature": 200,
          "invalid_signature": 401
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D1",
        "text": "Parcelly sends 'shipment.status_changed' webhooks to the registered URL. Spokes expects payment confirmations at '/orders/{id}/pay'. We need an adapter or mapping: either Parcelly posts directly to Spokes' endpoint with a transformed payload, or Spokes provides a webhook URL that accepts Parcelly's format and maps internally.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D2",
        "text": "Spokes needs to know the exact order ID format used in Parcelly to construct webhook URLs. Parcelly uses the partner's 'reference' field (e.g., 'ORD-1001') as the order identifier. Confirm this format is acceptable for Spokes' webhook routing.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
      "value": {
        "id": "D3",
        "text": "Spokes asks about signature/auth headers Parcelly expects on inbound webhooks. Parcelly does NOT send auth headers on webhooks; it only signs with X-Signature (HMAC-SHA256). Spokes must validate this signature. Confirm this is sufficient.",
        "owner": "provider"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/decisions/-",
